{"sourceUrl":"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/b9/61/c469a244065/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:08.926658+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/b9/61/c469a244065/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/><a href=\"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/b9/61/c469a244065/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>根据《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知》（药大研函〔</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>〕</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>34</span></span><span><span><span><span>号）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>等</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>文件精神，特制订本方案。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>一、接收硕士推免生</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>第二批次报名</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>专业目录</span></span></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>代码</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>100100</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>基础医学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>100706</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>药理学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>1007Z6</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>药物代谢动力学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（成药性评价技术与工程）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>105500</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>药学（临床药学）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>105500</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>药学（新药临床前评价）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>二</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、复试安排</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>条件</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）全国高校</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、基础医学类、食品科学与工程类、经济学类、统计学类、管理学类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）同一个学院同一批次内限填报</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个硕士志愿。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>考生不得在同一学院同一专业重复报名参加复试。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>报名方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>有意参加且预计获得推荐免试资格的全国各院校</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生可在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>00</span></span><span><span><span><span>登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span><span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”，并按提示上传报名材料。学院对申请人资格进行审核，并于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>11</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>点</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>前向入围的学生在系统中发送通知，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。收到通知学生请在接到通知后</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>小时内</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>登录</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>系统确认。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、复试形式</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/b9/61/c469a244065/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span>复试采用网络远程方式，拟使用“钉钉”</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>腾讯会议</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>等办公软件，考核全过程在我院</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>研究生招生委员会</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>及录取工作监督小组</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>的领导和监督下进行，严格坚持公开、公平、公正的原则。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/b9/61/c469a244065/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span>复试按照考生报考专业的情况分组进行。复试内容与考核形式由各学科确定，考核过程须坚持公开、公平、公正的原则。各学科将根据招生计划数及推免生报名情况，适时组织开展多批次复试录取工作，具体安排请随时关注我校研究生招生信息网和基础医学与临床药学学院网站。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>、复试时间安排</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>本批次</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>复试拟定于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>17</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日进行，具体时间</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>以及考试会议号</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>由考核组秘书老师另行通知。请保持预报名系统中填报的手机</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>及邮箱</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>畅通，一直不上线、并联系不上者，视为放弃本次复试。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学生参加复试前需</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>将</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>《</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>》（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>见附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>和</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>请在我校研究生招生信息网下载专区下载打印</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>签字盖章版扫描件发给考核组秘书老师。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>签字</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>盖章版原件</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>务必于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日前邮寄至基础医学与临床药学学院。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>邮寄信息：江苏省南京市江宁区龙眠大道</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>639</span></span><span><span><span><span>号中国药科大学基础医学与临床药学学院医学楼</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>109</span></span><span><span><span><span>办公室，陈老师，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>025-8618</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5969</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>（只能使用顺丰快递，不可使用其他快递；面单上详细标明“政审表”！）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>5、</span></span></strong><strong><span>复试联络群</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>请通过预报名系统审核，并确认参加面试的同学于</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>16</span></strong><strong><span>日（周</span></strong><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span>20</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong><strong><span>00</span></strong><strong><span>前加入对应学科复试联络群：</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span></span><span>基础医学、生物与医药（成药性评价技术与工程）</span><span>QQ</span><span>群群号：</span><span>1019013172</span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）</span></span><span>药理学</span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span>群群号：</span><span><span>1121069278</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）</span></span><span>药物代谢动力学</span><span>、</span><span>药学（临床药学）（专硕）</span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span>群群号：</span><span><span>1101583235</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）</span></span><span>药学（新药临床前评价）</span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span>群群号</span><span>：</span><span><span>1125543906</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>三</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、学院推免生接收工作联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>025-86185</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>969</span></span></span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:cdz@cpu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>cdz@cpu.edu.cn</span></span></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/b9/61/c469a244065/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>重点提醒：</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>我校推免拟录取的</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生，在全国推免服务系统开放（预计</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span><span><span>日）后，仍须在国家系统中注册并填报志愿，并根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。届时请关注我校研究生招生网和中国研究生招生信息网的通知。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://bmcp.cpu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/9e/22/2a42c929447c938ac89794554165/1ff0398f-68b5-4944-8ac1-faed685a7888.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件 中国药科大学 2027 年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书.pdf\">附件 中国药科大学 2027 年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书.pdf</a></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>中国药科大学基础医学与临床药学学院  </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日    </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>     </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"522c37c250e40ec4317c5beff83a062e1421d8d3948f1e4c437cdf5c0be9d878","textLength":1708,"sourceSha256":"0c694378cdb038297918c451d2ed15c3df972cbe0509977c2a82eee6c3c3bbea","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-170ba432bc9db8e748d3","title":"2026年中国药科大学基础医学与临床药学学院2027年招收推荐免试研究生第二批次预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:08.926658+00:00"}
